          "id": "10448",
          "body": "**Changes made:** \n\n\\[Screen\\] - Sign Up - In Progress (`Screen_Sign_Up_In_Progress`) — last saved 2026-09-02 6:21 PM UTC - v13\n\n* Added an Assignment element to capture the record's original (prior) values and its current (working) values into new flow variables.\n* Updated the screen element to reference the new variables instead of the default field bindings.\n* Added a second Assignment element to populate fields not referenced by the screen flow by default, so they are included in the comparison.\n* Added a Decision element that checks whether Status__c is New and no field values changed.\n* Added a new screen that displays when Status__c is New and no fields were changed. It tells the user the record will not advance to In Progress unless a field is filled in.\n* Preserved the existing path for records where a field value did change — these continue to advance Status__c to In Progress as before.\n\n**Testing:** Validated in sandbox.",
          "created": "2026-09-03T11:54:41.348-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-03T11:54:41.348-0400",
